      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "This Act extends to acts, omissions, matters and things outside\nAustralia.\n\n\nIntroduction  Part 1\nObjects  Division 2\n\nSection 6\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "This Act extends to acts, omissions, matters and things outside\nAustralia.\n\n\nIntroduction  Part 1\nObjects  Division 2\n\nSection 6\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
