      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1) of this section, section 10 does not\napply to liability for an offence against section 137.1, 137.2, 144.1\nor 145.1 of the Criminal Code.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1) of this section, section 10 does not\napply to liability for an offence against section 137.1, 137.2, 144.1\nor 145.1 of the Criminal Code.",
      "values:partOf": {
