      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to an individual (the witness) who provides\nassistance in relation to a public interest disclosure (other than the\nindividual who makes the disclosure), subject to section 12B.\nMeaning of provides assistance",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-12a"
      },
