        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-12b-ss-5-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b5403052613469380cd60071d1250b2461106a3f90489745c1b91779193e3f73",
      "skos:note": "Witnesses' liability for conduct not affected by section 12A"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-12b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12B(5) Witnesses—exceptions to immunities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, if the assistance provided relates to the witness’\nown conduct, section 12A does not affect the witness’ liability for\nthe conduct.\n\n\nProtection of disclosers and witnesses  Part 2\nProtections  Division 1\n\nSection 13\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nSubdivision B—Protection from reprisals"
    },
