    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-21",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "21 Identifying information not to be disclosed etc. to courts or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-21"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "tribunals\n\nA person who is, or has been, a public official is not to be required:\n\n(a) to disclose to a court or tribunal identifying information that\nthe person has obtained; or\n\n(b) to produce to a court or tribunal a document containing\nidentifying information that the person has obtained;\nexcept where it is necessary to do so for the purposes of giving\neffect to this Act.\nSubdivision D—Interaction with the Fair Work Act 2009",
      "skos:definition": "tribunals\n\nA person who is, or has been, a public official is not to be required:\n\n(a) to disclose to a court or tribunal identifying information that\nthe person has obtained; or\n\n(b) to produce to a court or tribunal a document containing\nidentifying information that the person has obtained;\nexcept where it is necessary to do so for the purposes of giving\neffect to this Act.\nSubdivision D—Interaction with the Fair Work Act 2009",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-21-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-21-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "84b75c0ab24598079463f423237326ff94b502f9d235af4c42fb9e28e3fc6076",
      "skos:note": "Public officials cannot disclose identifying information to courts or tribunals."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-21",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21 Identifying information not to be disclosed etc. to courts or",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "tribunals\n\nA person who is, or has been, a public official is not to be required:\n\n(a) to disclose to a court or tribunal identifying information that\nthe person has obtained; or\n\n(b) to produce to a court or tribunal a document containing\nidentifying information that the person has obtained;\nexcept where it is necessary to do so for the purposes of giving\neffect to this Act.\nSubdivision D—Interaction with the Fair Work Act 2009"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-21-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-21"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-21-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits disclosure of identifying information.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-22",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22 Interaction with protections under Part 3-1 of the Fair Work Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-22"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "Without limiting the operation of the Fair Work Act 2009, Part 3-1\nof that Act applies in relation to the making of a public interest\ndisclosure by a public official who is, or has been, an employee\n(within the meaning of that Part) as if, for the purposes of that Act:\n\n(a) this Act were a workplace law; and\n\n(b) making that disclosure were a process or proceeding under a\nworkplace law.",
      "skos:definition": "Without limiting the operation of the Fair Work Act 2009, Part 3-1\nof that Act applies in relation to the making of a public interest\ndisclosure by a public official who is, or has been, an employee\n(within the meaning of that Part) as if, for the purposes of that Act:\n\n(a) this Act were a workplace law; and\n\n(b) making that disclosure were a process or proceeding under a\nworkplace law.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-22-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "728e471814f67421c6691dd395b05e05035d78a5203cf4219bef3d7006a843f0",
      "skos:note": "Part 3-1 of the Fair Work Act applies to public interest disclosure by a public official."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-22",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22 Interaction with protections under Part 3-1 of the Fair Work Act",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "Without limiting the operation of the Fair Work Act 2009, Part 3-1\nof that Act applies in relation to the making of a public interest\ndisclosure by a public official who is, or has been, an employee\n(within the meaning of that Part) as if, for the purposes of that Act:\n\n(a) this Act were a workplace law; and\n\n(b) making that disclosure were a process or proceeding under a\nworkplace law."
    },
    {
