      "cml:logicSummary": "Contract services",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) provides services for the purposes (whether direct or indirect) of the Commonwealth contract;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the individual does not engage in conduct in connection with his or her position as such a public official unless the conduct is in connection with entering into, or giving effect to, the contract."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Contractor service provision",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) provides services for the purposes (whether direct or indirect) of the Commonwealth contract;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the individual does not engage in conduct in connection with his or her position as such a public official unless the conduct is in connection with entering into, or giving effect to, the contract."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30(2) Officers or employees of a contracted service provider",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-30-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A contracted service provider for a Commonwealth contract is:\n\n(a) a person who:\n\n(i) is a party to the Commonwealth contract; and\n\n(ii) is responsible for the provision of goods or services\nunder the Commonwealth contract; or\n\n(b) a person who:\n\n(i) is a party to a contract (the subcontract) with a person\nwho is a contracted service provider for the\nCommonwealth contract under paragraph (a) (or under a\nprevious application of this paragraph); and\n\n(ii) is responsible under the subcontract for the provision of\ngoods or services for the purposes (whether direct or\nindirect) of the Commonwealth contract.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A contracted service provider for a Commonwealth contract is:\n\n(a) a person who:\n\n(i) is a party to the Commonwealth contract; and\n\n(ii) is responsible for the provision of goods or services\nunder the Commonwealth contract; or\n\n(b) a person who:\n\n(i) is a party to a contract (the subcontract) with a person\nwho is a contracted service provider for the\nCommonwealth contract under paragraph (a) (or under a\nprevious application of this paragraph); and\n\n(ii) is responsible under the subcontract for the provision of\ngoods or services for the purposes (whether direct or\nindirect) of the Commonwealth contract.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-argumentation-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f86bba4263c8f1ebaa20accef4e5e23c991974e7066a1aa96a14f106b359cc3a",
      "skos:note": "A contracted service provider for a Commonwealth contract is responsible for the provision of goods or services."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-30-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30(2) Officers or employees of a contracted service provider",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A contracted service provider for a Commonwealth contract is:\n\n(a) a person who:\n\n(i) is a party to the Commonwealth contract; and\n\n(ii) is responsible for the provision of goods or services\nunder the Commonwealth contract; or\n\n(b) a person who:\n\n(i) is a party to a contract (the subcontract) with a person\nwho is a contracted service provider for the\nCommonwealth contract under paragraph (a) (or under a\nprevious application of this paragraph); and\n\n(ii) is responsible under the subcontract for the provision of\ngoods or services for the purposes (whether direct or\nindirect) of the Commonwealth contract."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "is",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Definition of a contracted service provider",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A person is a contracted service provider if they are responsible for the provision of goods or services.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A contracted service provider is defined as someone who is responsible for the provision of goods or services."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal scope of a contracted service provider's responsibility",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A person who is responsible for the provision of goods or services under the Commonwealth contract is also responsible during the duration of the contract.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The temporal scope of a contracted service provider's responsibility is during the duration of the contract."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "everywhere",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Global applicability of a contracted service provider's responsibility",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A person who is responsible for the provision of goods or services under the Commonwealth contract is also responsible everywhere during the duration of the contract.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The global applicability of a contracted service provider's responsibility is everywhere during the duration of the contract."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "must",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Mandatory nature of a contracted service provider's responsibility",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A person who is responsible for the provision of goods or services under the Commonwealth contract must provide those goods or services.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The mandatory nature of a contracted service provider's responsibility is to provide goods or services."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-2-logic-argumentation-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "if-then",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Consequence of a contracted service provider's responsibility",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "If a person is responsible for the provision of goods or services under the Commonwealth contract, then they must provide those goods or services.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The consequence of a contracted service provider's responsibility is that they must provide goods or services."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30(3) Officers or employees of a contracted service provider",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-30-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A Commonwealth contract is a contract:\n\n(a) to which the Commonwealth or an agency is a party; and\n\n\nProtection of disclosers and witnesses  Part 2\nPublic interest disclosures  Division 2\n\nSection 31\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) under which goods or services are to be, or were to be,\nprovided:\n\n(i) to the Commonwealth or an agency; or\n\n(ii) for or on behalf of the Commonwealth or an agency,\nand in connection with the performance of its functions\nor the exercise of its powers.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A Commonwealth contract is a contract:\n\n(a) to which the Commonwealth or an agency is a party; and\n\n\nProtection of disclosers and witnesses  Part 2\nPublic interest disclosures  Division 2\n\nSection 31\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) under which goods or services are to be, or were to be,\nprovided:\n\n(i) to the Commonwealth or an agency; or\n\n(ii) for or on behalf of the Commonwealth or an agency,\nand in connection with the performance of its functions\nor the exercise of its powers.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4320f0bc55298d84892cc659d1cc9268c88910bcf4bf824d14867e77f80f4e0c",
      "skos:note": "A Commonwealth contract is a contract to which the Commonwealth or an agency is a party."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-30-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30(3) Officers or employees of a contracted service provider",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A Commonwealth contract is a contract:\n\n(a) to which the Commonwealth or an agency is a party; and\n\n\nProtection of disclosers and witnesses  Part 2\nPublic interest disclosures  Division 2\n\nSection 31\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) under which goods or services are to be, or were to be,\nprovided:\n\n(i) to the Commonwealth or an agency; or\n\n(ii) for or on behalf of the Commonwealth or an agency,\nand in connection with the performance of its functions\nor the exercise of its powers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "is",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines a Commonwealth contract.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30(4) Officers or employees of a contracted service provider",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-30-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, a Commonwealth contract does not include a grant\ncovered by an instrument made under section 105C of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013\n(instruments relating to grants).\n31  Disagreements with government policies etc.\n\nTo avoid doubt, conduct is not disclosable conduct if it relates only\nto:\n\n(a) a policy or proposed policy of the Commonwealth\nGovernment; or\n\n(b) action that has been, is being, or is proposed to be, taken by:\n\n(i) a Minister; or\n\n(ii) the Speaker of the House of Representatives; or\n\n(iii) the President of the Senate; or\n\n(c) amounts, purposes or priorities of expenditure or proposed\nexpenditure relating to such a policy or proposed policy, or\nsuch action or proposed action;\nwith which a person disagrees.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) However, a Commonwealth contract does not include a grant\ncovered by an instrument made under section 105C of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013\n(instruments relating to grants).\n31  Disagreements with government policies etc.\n\nTo avoid doubt, conduct is not disclosable conduct if it relates only\nto:\n\n(a) a policy or proposed policy of the Commonwealth\nGovernment; or\n\n(b) action that has been, is being, or is proposed to be, taken by:\n\n(i) a Minister; or\n\n(ii) the Speaker of the House of Representatives; or\n\n(iii) the President of the Senate; or\n\n(c) amounts, purposes or priorities of expenditure or proposed\nexpenditure relating to such a policy or proposed policy, or\nsuch action or proposed action;\nwith which a person disagrees.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-argumentation-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "84438e91bdd3337006e39a80f57194ff215c8711d9cbc8dd6f47f1263c76bd5e",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from disclosure of conduct related to government policies or actions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-30-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30(4) Officers or employees of a contracted service provider",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, a Commonwealth contract does not include a grant\ncovered by an instrument made under section 105C of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013\n(instruments relating to grants).\n31  Disagreements with government policies etc.\n\nTo avoid doubt, conduct is not disclosable conduct if it relates only\nto:\n\n(a) a policy or proposed policy of the Commonwealth\nGovernment; or\n\n(b) action that has been, is being, or is proposed to be, taken by:\n\n(i) a Minister; or\n\n(ii) the Speaker of the House of Representatives; or\n\n(iii) the President of the Senate; or\n\n(c) amounts, purposes or priorities of expenditure or proposed\nexpenditure relating to such a policy or proposed policy, or\nsuch action or proposed action;\nwith which a person disagrees."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "exemption",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exemptions from disclosure of conduct.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Conduct not disclosable if related to government policy or action.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Obligation to disclose conduct waived."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exemptions apply during periods of government policy or action.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Conduct not disclosable if related to government policy or action.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Exemption applies during specific time periods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "until",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exemptions apply until government policy or action ceases.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Conduct not disclosable if related to government policy or action.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Exemption applies until specific conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "through",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exemptions apply through government channels.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Conduct not disclosable if related to government policy or action.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Exemption applies through official channels."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-30-ss-4-logic-argumentation-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "for",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exemptions apply in support of government policies or actions.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Conduct not disclosable if related to government policy or action.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Exemption applies in specific contexts."
    },
    {
