      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.57",
      "values:originalText": "Scope—disclosers\n\n(1) This section applies in relation to a person (the discloser) if:\n\n(a) the discloser discloses information to an authorised officer of\nan agency (the recipient agency); or\n\n(b) the discloser discloses information to the discloser’s\nsupervisor, who then gives the information to an authorised",
      "skos:definition": "Scope—disclosers\n\n(1) This section applies in relation to a person (the discloser) if:\n\n(a) the discloser discloses information to an authorised officer of\nan agency (the recipient agency); or\n\n(b) the discloser discloses information to the discloser’s\nsupervisor, who then gives the information to an authorised",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-43-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-43-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4cbdc8af6ce6ef35f053eac90a2e10bf885ffa317abcf9250cde89f7c6e5f444",
      "skos:note": "Discloser must disclose information to an authorised officer of an agency."
    },
    {
