      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "43 Allocation of disclosure—decision by authorised officer",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 57,
      "values:originalText": "Scope—disclosers\n\n(1) This section applies in relation to a person (the discloser) if:\n\n(a) the discloser discloses information to an authorised officer of\nan agency (the recipient agency); or\n\n(b) the discloser discloses information to the discloser’s\nsupervisor, who then gives the information to an authorised"
    },
