      "values:originalText": "(3) This subsection covers the following persons and agencies:\n\n(a) the principal officer of each agency to which the disclosure is\nallocated;\n\n(b) the Ombudsman, if the disclosure is allocated to an agency\nother than:\n\n(i) the Ombudsman; or\n\n(ii) the IGIS; or\n\n(iii) an intelligence agency; or\n\n(iv) AUSTRAC, the Department of Home Affairs or the\nAustralian Federal Police in relation to that agency’s\nintelligence functions;\n\n(c) the IGIS, if the recipient agency (under subsection 43(1)) is,\nor the disclosure is allocated to:\n\n\nInvestigations  Part 3\nAllocating the handling of disclosures  Division 1\n\nSection 44A\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(i) an intelligence agency; or\n\n(ii) AUSTRAC, the Department of Home Affairs or the\nAustralian Federal Police in relation to that agency’s\nintelligence functions.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) This subsection covers the following persons and agencies:\n\n(a) the principal officer of each agency to which the disclosure is\nallocated;\n\n(b) the Ombudsman, if the disclosure is allocated to an agency\nother than:\n\n(i) the Ombudsman; or\n\n(ii) the IGIS; or\n\n(iii) an intelligence agency; or\n\n(iv) AUSTRAC, the Department of Home Affairs or the\nAustralian Federal Police in relation to that agency’s\nintelligence functions;\n\n(c) the IGIS, if the recipient agency (under subsection 43(1)) is,\nor the disclosure is allocated to:\n\n\nInvestigations  Part 3\nAllocating the handling of disclosures  Division 1\n\nSection 44A\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(i) an intelligence agency; or\n\n(ii) AUSTRAC, the Department of Home Affairs or the\nAustralian Federal Police in relation to that agency’s\nintelligence functions.",
