          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-44b-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5c30a95486e8cb5dd479e8face9440b8b13c1f5a80ff491cbd0617369b077ad2",
      "skos:note": "List of matters for disclosure purposes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-44b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44B(3) Non-allocation of disclosure subject to stop action direction",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 65,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The following are the matters for the purposes of subsection (2):\n\n(a) the information that was disclosed;\n\n(b) the conduct disclosed;\n\n(c) if the discloser’s name and contact details are known to the\nauthorised officer, and the discloser consents to the\nOmbudsman or the IGIS, as relevant, being informed—the\ndiscloser’s name and contact details;\n\n(d) the stop action direction under the NACC Act that prevents\nallocation of some or all of the disclosure."
    },
