    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-45a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45A(4) Conduct related to intelligence agencies and agencies with",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-45a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.66",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the disclosure is investigated under Division 2, the principal\nofficer of the agency to which the disclosure is allocated must give\nregular written notice to the IGIS about the following matters:\n\n(a) the progress of the investigation;\n\n(b) the anticipated time remaining before the investigation is\ncompleted;\n\n(c) the likelihood of any extension, or further extension, of the\ntime for completion of the investigation being required under\nsubsection 52(4).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the disclosure is investigated under Division 2, the principal\nofficer of the agency to which the disclosure is allocated must give\nregular written notice to the IGIS about the following matters:\n\n(a) the progress of the investigation;\n\n(b) the anticipated time remaining before the investigation is\ncompleted;\n\n(c) the likelihood of any extension, or further extension, of the\ntime for completion of the investigation being required under\nsubsection 52(4).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-45a"
      },
