        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-45a-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-45a-ss-4-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-45a-ss-4-logic-diffusion-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b1bd6c34ae1cbd452d02efe184665e3e7365c17a1965a9891076f524ab814325",
      "skos:note": "Principal officer must provide regular written notice to IGIS about investigation progress and expected completion time.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-45a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45A(4) Conduct related to intelligence agencies and agencies with",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the disclosure is investigated under Division 2, the principal\nofficer of the agency to which the disclosure is allocated must give\nregular written notice to the IGIS about the following matters:\n\n(a) the progress of the investigation;\n\n(b) the anticipated time remaining before the investigation is\ncompleted;\n\n(c) the likelihood of any extension, or further extension, of the\ntime for completion of the investigation being required under\nsubsection 52(4)."
    },
