      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.77",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The investigation is completed when the principal officer has\nprepared the report of the investigation.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The investigation is completed when the principal officer has\nprepared the report of the investigation.",
