    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-52-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52(3) Time limit for investigations under this Division",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-52-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.77",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the agency is not the IGIS or an intelligence agency, the\nOmbudsman may extend, or further extend, the 90-day period by\nsuch additional period (which may exceed 90 days) as the\nOmbudsman considers appropriate:\n\n(a) on the Ombudsman’s own initiative; or\n\n(b) if the agency is not the Ombudsman—on application made\nby the principal officer of the agency; or",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the agency is not the IGIS or an intelligence agency, the\nOmbudsman may extend, or further extend, the 90-day period by\nsuch additional period (which may exceed 90 days) as the\nOmbudsman considers appropriate:\n\n(a) on the Ombudsman’s own initiative; or\n\n(b) if the agency is not the Ombudsman—on application made\nby the principal officer of the agency; or",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-52"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-52-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-52-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "14acc2f9e30de09709d8139fd697be946d17c387b6af6a5513505f949b79de72",
      "skos:note": "Extension of time limit for investigations under this Division"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-52-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52(3) Time limit for investigations under this Division",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 77,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the agency is not the IGIS or an intelligence agency, the\nOmbudsman may extend, or further extend, the 90-day period by\nsuch additional period (which may exceed 90 days) as the\nOmbudsman considers appropriate:\n\n(a) on the Ombudsman’s own initiative; or\n\n(b) if the agency is not the Ombudsman—on application made\nby the principal officer of the agency; or"
    },
    {
