    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-53-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53(4) Conduct of investigations under this Division",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-53-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.78",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Despite subsections (1) and (2), the principal officer must act in\naccordance with any rules relating to fraud that are made for the\npurposes of the Public Governance, Performance and\nAccountability Act 2013, to the extent that:\n\n(a) the investigation relates to one or more instances of fraud;\nand\n\n(b) those rules are not inconsistent with this Act (apart from\nsubsections (1) and (2)).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Despite subsections (1) and (2), the principal officer must act in\naccordance with any rules relating to fraud that are made for the\npurposes of the Public Governance, Performance and\nAccountability Act 2013, to the extent that:\n\n(a) the investigation relates to one or more instances of fraud;\nand\n\n(b) those rules are not inconsistent with this Act (apart from\nsubsections (1) and (2)).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-53"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-53-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-53-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-53-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "67f529f16d404277217caf1fe9326c57ab16e64a258c5c343256dfd1a7106e57",
      "skos:note": "Must act in accordance with rules relating to fraud made for the purposes of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-53-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53(4) Conduct of investigations under this Division",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 78,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Despite subsections (1) and (2), the principal officer must act in\naccordance with any rules relating to fraud that are made for the\npurposes of the Public Governance, Performance and\nAccountability Act 2013, to the extent that:\n\n(a) the investigation relates to one or more instances of fraud;\nand\n\n(b) those rules are not inconsistent with this Act (apart from\nsubsections (1) and (2))."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-53-ss-4-norm",
