      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The investigator may give the relevant information to a member of\nan Australian police force responsible for the investigation of the\noffence.\nDuty to give information to police",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The investigator may give the relevant information to a member of\nan Australian police force responsible for the investigation of the\noffence.\nDuty to give information to police",
