      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Investigator has a duty to give relevant information",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Member of police force must receive information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56(3) Disclosure to a member of an Australian police force",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-56-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, if the investigator suspects on reasonable grounds that\nthe offence is punishable by imprisonment for life or by\nimprisonment for a period of at least 2 years, the investigator must\ngive the relevant information to a member of an Australian police\nforce responsible for the investigation of the offence.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) However, if the investigator suspects on reasonable grounds that\nthe offence is punishable by imprisonment for life or by\nimprisonment for a period of at least 2 years, the investigator must\ngive the relevant information to a member of an Australian police\nforce responsible for the investigation of the offence.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3018572b5efc6a24564a0bcd76df4a065e283a2712512d2f2a4d90c71c5f335d",
      "skos:note": "Investigator must disclose information to a member of an Australian police force under certain circumstances.",
      "dc:description": "True"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-56-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56(3) Disclosure to a member of an Australian police force",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 82,
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, if the investigator suspects on reasonable grounds that\nthe offence is punishable by imprisonment for life or by\nimprisonment for a period of at least 2 years, the investigator must\ngive the relevant information to a member of an Australian police\nforce responsible for the investigation of the offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to disclose information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Reasonable grounds"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56(4) Disclosure to a member of an Australian police force",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-56-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, subsection (3) does not apply:\n\n(a) if the investigator believes on reasonable grounds that the\nagency to which the investigator belongs has the capacity and\nthe appropriate skills and resources needed:\n\n(i) to investigate the commission of the offence; and\n\n(ii) to meet the requirements of the Commonwealth\nDirector of Public Prosecutions in gathering evidence\nand preparing briefs of evidence in relation to the\ncommission of the offence; or\n\n(b) if the investigator suspects on reasonable grounds that the\nrelevant information raises a corruption issue (within the\nmeaning of the National Anti-Corruption Commission Act\n2022) and:\n\n(i) the corruption issue has been referred under that Act to\nthe person or agency mentioned in subsection (4A); or\n\n(ii) that person or agency is already aware of the issue.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) However, subsection (3) does not apply:\n\n(a) if the investigator believes on reasonable grounds that the\nagency to which the investigator belongs has the capacity and\nthe appropriate skills and resources needed:\n\n(i) to investigate the commission of the offence; and\n\n(ii) to meet the requirements of the Commonwealth\nDirector of Public Prosecutions in gathering evidence\nand preparing briefs of evidence in relation to the\ncommission of the offence; or\n\n(b) if the investigator suspects on reasonable grounds that the\nrelevant information raises a corruption issue (within the\nmeaning of the National Anti-Corruption Commission Act\n2022) and:\n\n(i) the corruption issue has been referred under that Act to\nthe person or agency mentioned in subsection (4A); or\n\n(ii) that person or agency is already aware of the issue.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b87948708568aab238917d31fb966e2081ec552929e4b3a3b1ef08177cf1ec83",
      "skos:note": "Exemption from subsection (3) for certain investigations and corruption issues."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-56-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56(4) Disclosure to a member of an Australian police force",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 82,
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, subsection (3) does not apply:\n\n(a) if the investigator believes on reasonable grounds that the\nagency to which the investigator belongs has the capacity and\nthe appropriate skills and resources needed:\n\n(i) to investigate the commission of the offence; and\n\n(ii) to meet the requirements of the Commonwealth\nDirector of Public Prosecutions in gathering evidence\nand preparing briefs of evidence in relation to the\ncommission of the offence; or\n\n(b) if the investigator suspects on reasonable grounds that the\nrelevant information raises a corruption issue (within the\nmeaning of the National Anti-Corruption Commission Act\n2022) and:\n\n(i) the corruption issue has been referred under that Act to\nthe person or agency mentioned in subsection (4A); or\n\n(ii) that person or agency is already aware of the issue."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Permission to investigate without subsection (3) applying.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) However, subsection (3) does not apply:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal overlap between subsection (3) and exemption.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) to investigate the commission of the offence; and (ii) to meet the requirements of the Commonwealth Director of Public Prosecutions in gathering evidence and preparing briefs of evidence in relation to the commission of the offence;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Repeats",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Repeating pattern of exemption for certain investigations.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) if the investigator believes on reasonable grounds that the agency to which the investigator belongs has the capacity and the appropriate skills and resources needed:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Permission for corruption issue referral.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) if the investigator suspects on reasonable grounds that the relevant information raises a corruption issue (within the meaning of the National Anti-Corruption Commission Act 2022) and:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56(4A) Disclosure to a member of an Australian police force",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-56-ss-4a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(4A) For the purposes of paragraph (4)(b), the person or agency is:\n\n(a) the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner; or\n\n(b) the IGIS, if the corruption issue concerns:\n\n(i) an intelligence agency; or",
      "skos:definition": "(4A) For the purposes of paragraph (4)(b), the person or agency is:\n\n(a) the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner; or\n\n(b) the IGIS, if the corruption issue concerns:\n\n(i) an intelligence agency; or",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cd5abdbcc128ba6d0dfe685752ee986558cfd49316d362a7cd858222814fbf09",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of corruption issue to a member of an Australian police force"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-56-ss-4a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56(4A) Disclosure to a member of an Australian police force",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 82,
      "values:originalText": "(4A) For the purposes of paragraph (4)(b), the person or agency is:\n\n(a) the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner; or\n\n(b) the IGIS, if the corruption issue concerns:\n\n(i) an intelligence agency; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-56-ss-4a-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "hasObligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "State has obligation to disclose corruption issue",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-58",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58 Simplified outline",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-58"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.85",
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Division:\nThis Division promotes the operation of this Act by imposing\nadditional obligations on principal officers, authorised officers,\nsupervisors and public officials, and by conferring additional\nfunctions on the Ombudsman and the IGIS.\nNote:\nThe way the additional obligations are complied with (or\nnon-compliance with the additional obligations) may be the subject of\na complaint to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976, or\n(in the case of an intelligence agency, or AUSTRAC, the Department\nof Home Affairs or the Australian Federal Police in relation to that\nagency’s intelligence functions) to the IGIS under the\nInspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986.",
      "skos:definition": "The following is a simplified outline of this Division:\nThis Division promotes the operation of this Act by imposing\nadditional obligations on principal officers, authorised officers,\nsupervisors and public officials, and by conferring additional\nfunctions on the Ombudsman and the IGIS.\nNote:\nThe way the additional obligations are complied with (or\nnon-compliance with the additional obligations) may be the subject of\na complaint to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976, or\n(in the case of an intelligence agency, or AUSTRAC, the Department\nof Home Affairs or the Australian Federal Police in relation to that\nagency’s intelligence functions) to the IGIS under the\nInspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-58-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6c23e0dfce32ab8d9bb56f4ed42c0f8bfcc3ef83dcc8f8841722ee307b637db8",
      "skos:note": "Additional obligations on principal officers, authorised officers, supervisors and public officials."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-58",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58 Simplified outline",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 85,
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Division:\nThis Division promotes the operation of this Act by imposing\nadditional obligations on principal officers, authorised officers,\nsupervisors and public officials, and by conferring additional\nfunctions on the Ombudsman and the IGIS.\nNote:\nThe way the additional obligations are complied with (or\nnon-compliance with the additional obligations) may be the subject of\na complaint to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976, or\n(in the case of an intelligence agency, or AUSTRAC, the Department\nof Home Affairs or the Australian Federal Police in relation to that\nagency’s intelligence functions) to the IGIS under the\nInspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-58-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-58"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-59",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "59 Additional obligations of principal officers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-59"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
