      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.85",
      "values:originalText": "Facilitating public interest disclosures\n\n(1) The principal officer of an agency must take reasonable steps to\nensure that:\n\n(a) the number of authorised officers of the agency is sufficient\nto ensure that they are readily accessible by public officials\nwho belong to the agency; and\n\n(b) public officials who belong to the agency are aware of the\nidentity of each authorised officer of the agency.\n\n(2) The principal officer of an agency must take reasonable steps to\nencourage and support:\n\n(a) public officials who make, or are considering making, public\ninterest disclosures relating to the agency; and",
      "skos:definition": "Facilitating public interest disclosures\n\n(1) The principal officer of an agency must take reasonable steps to\nensure that:\n\n(a) the number of authorised officers of the agency is sufficient\nto ensure that they are readily accessible by public officials\nwho belong to the agency; and\n\n(b) public officials who belong to the agency are aware of the\nidentity of each authorised officer of the agency.\n\n(2) The principal officer of an agency must take reasonable steps to\nencourage and support:\n\n(a) public officials who make, or are considering making, public\ninterest disclosures relating to the agency; and",
      "cml:hasPart": [
