    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-60",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "60 Additional obligations of authorised officers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-60"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) an individual discloses, or proposes to disclose, information\nto an authorised officer of an agency; and\n\n(b) the authorised officer has reasonable grounds to believe that:\n\n(i) the information concerns, or could concern, disclosable\nconduct; and\n\n(ii) the individual may be unaware of the consequences of\nmaking the disclosure;\nthe authorised officer must:\n\n(c) inform the individual that the disclosure could be treated as\nan internal disclosure for the purposes of this Act; and\n\n(d) explain what this Act requires in order for the disclosure to\nbe an internal disclosure; and",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) an individual discloses, or proposes to disclose, information\nto an authorised officer of an agency; and\n\n(b) the authorised officer has reasonable grounds to believe that:\n\n(i) the information concerns, or could concern, disclosable\nconduct; and\n\n(ii) the individual may be unaware of the consequences of\nmaking the disclosure;\nthe authorised officer must:\n\n(c) inform the individual that the disclosure could be treated as\nan internal disclosure for the purposes of this Act; and\n\n(d) explain what this Act requires in order for the disclosure to\nbe an internal disclosure; and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-60-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-60-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-60-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-60-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-60-logic-diffusion-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0d2a0239e421cec1c18ad8754ae8f66b9bced8d70c78eaa4ff26178d7b15a46d",
      "skos:note": "Authorised officer must inform individual about potential internal disclosure.",
      "dc:description": "Information to be disclosed"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-60",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60 Additional obligations of authorised officers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 87,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) an individual discloses, or proposes to disclose, information\nto an authorised officer of an agency; and\n\n(b) the authorised officer has reasonable grounds to believe that:\n\n(i) the information concerns, or could concern, disclosable\nconduct; and\n\n(ii) the individual may be unaware of the consequences of\nmaking the disclosure;\nthe authorised officer must:\n\n(c) inform the individual that the disclosure could be treated as\nan internal disclosure for the purposes of this Act; and\n\n(d) explain what this Act requires in order for the disclosure to\nbe an internal disclosure; and"
    },
