          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-61-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5dab60ad067c68d829faba802bda37fc84b22eaf1af5bf999f61f5f5393ea8ed"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-61",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "61 Additional obligations of public officials",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 89,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A public official must use his or her best endeavours to assist the\nprincipal officer of an agency in the conduct of an investigation\nunder Division 2 of Part 3.\n\n(2) A public official must use his or her best endeavours to assist the\nOmbudsman in the performance of the Ombudsman’s functions\nunder this Act.\n\n(3) A public official must use his or her best endeavours to assist the\nIGIS in the performance of the IGIS’s functions under this Act."
    },
