      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Division:\nThis Division defines the key concepts of public official, agency,\nprescribed authority and principal officer.\nSubdivision A—Public officials",
      "skos:definition": "The following is a simplified outline of this Division:\nThis Division defines the key concepts of public official, agency,\nprescribed authority and principal officer.\nSubdivision A—Public officials",
      "cml:asserts": [
