    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-70-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "70(3) Individuals taken to be public officials",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-70-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the individual requests an authorised officer of an agency to\nmake the determination, the authorised officer must, after\nconsidering the request:\n\n(a) make the determination, and inform the individual\naccordingly; or\n\n(b) refuse to make the determination, and inform the individual\nof the refusal and the reasons for the refusal.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the individual requests an authorised officer of an agency to\nmake the determination, the authorised officer must, after\nconsidering the request:\n\n(a) make the determination, and inform the individual\naccordingly; or\n\n(b) refuse to make the determination, and inform the individual\nof the refusal and the reasons for the refusal.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-70"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-70-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-70-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1811e1773e2331ef3072f2a5ecbaa9c7c39aae92e7ec60a41a732ac3b8bfa3c6",
      "skos:note": "Authorised officer must make determination after considering individual's request.",
      "dc:description": "Reasons for refusal (if applicable)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-70-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "70(3) Individuals taken to be public officials",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the individual requests an authorised officer of an agency to\nmake the determination, the authorised officer must, after\nconsidering the request:\n\n(a) make the determination, and inform the individual\naccordingly; or\n\n(b) refuse to make the determination, and inform the individual\nof the refusal and the reasons for the refusal."
    },
