    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "73A Scope of Subdivision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-73a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "This Subdivision applies if:\n\n(a) either of the following (a machinery of government change)\noccurs in relation to an agency (the affected agency) at a\nparticular time (the change time):\n\n(i) the affected agency is abolished;\n\n(ii) there is a change to the matters dealt with by the\naffected agency; and\n\n(b) as a result of the machinery of government change, a function\n(a transferred function) of the affected agency is transferred\nto another agency (the new agency).\n\n\nAdministrative matters  Part 4\nOfficials and agencies  Division 3\n\nSection 73B\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "This Subdivision applies if:\n\n(a) either of the following (a machinery of government change)\noccurs in relation to an agency (the affected agency) at a\nparticular time (the change time):\n\n(i) the affected agency is abolished;\n\n(ii) there is a change to the matters dealt with by the\naffected agency; and\n\n(b) as a result of the machinery of government change, a function\n(a transferred function) of the affected agency is transferred\nto another agency (the new agency).\n\n\nAdministrative matters  Part 4\nOfficials and agencies  Division 3\n\nSection 73B\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73a-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c42d9254107c6e7914ee79c60a35275a3116e35cb57fb177a4c04debe92ca3d0",
      "skos:note": "Scope of Subdivision"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-73a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "73A Scope of Subdivision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 104,
      "values:originalText": "This Subdivision applies if:\n\n(a) either of the following (a machinery of government change)\noccurs in relation to an agency (the affected agency) at a\nparticular time (the change time):\n\n(i) the affected agency is abolished;\n\n(ii) there is a change to the matters dealt with by the\naffected agency; and\n\n(b) as a result of the machinery of government change, a function\n(a transferred function) of the affected agency is transferred\nto another agency (the new agency).\n\n\nAdministrative matters  Part 4\nOfficials and agencies  Division 3\n\nSection 73B\n\nPublic Interest Disclosure Act 2013\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "73B Machinery of government changes—conduct relating to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-73b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.105",
      "values:originalText": "affected agency\n\nDespite section 35 (which defines when conduct relates to an\nagency), conduct that occurred before the change time and that\nwould, apart from this section, relate to the affected agency is\ninstead taken, for the purposes of this Act, to relate to the new\nagency if:\n\n(a) the conduct relates to a transferred function; or\n\n(b) the PID rules provide that conduct of that kind is to be taken\nto relate to the new agency.",
      "skos:definition": "affected agency\n\nDespite section 35 (which defines when conduct relates to an\nagency), conduct that occurred before the change time and that\nwould, apart from this section, relate to the affected agency is\ninstead taken, for the purposes of this Act, to relate to the new\nagency if:\n\n(a) the conduct relates to a transferred function; or\n\n(b) the PID rules provide that conduct of that kind is to be taken\nto relate to the new agency.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73b-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9481d385cb2b56c7ee56a340d94db8e3e3a369260c67a33c7695aae9ea9b607e",
      "skos:note": "Conduct before change time relates to new agency under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-73b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "73B Machinery of government changes—conduct relating to",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 105,
      "values:originalText": "affected agency\n\nDespite section 35 (which defines when conduct relates to an\nagency), conduct that occurred before the change time and that\nwould, apart from this section, relate to the affected agency is\ninstead taken, for the purposes of this Act, to relate to the new\nagency if:\n\n(a) the conduct relates to a transferred function; or\n\n(b) the PID rules provide that conduct of that kind is to be taken\nto relate to the new agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73b-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73b"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "73C Machinery of government changes—disclosures made before",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-73c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.105",
      "values:originalText": "change\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) before the change time, a person disclosed information to an\nauthorised officer of an affected agency, or to a supervisor\nbelonging to the affected agency; and\n\n(b) the information concerns conduct that is taken to relate to the\nnew agency under section 73B; and\n\n(c) immediately before the change time, consideration of the\ndisclosure under this Act had not started, or (if it had started)\nhad not ended.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) the disclosure is taken to have been made to an authorised\nofficer of the new agency, or to a supervisor belonging to the\nnew agency; and\n\n(b) if the disclosure had, before the change time, been allocated\nto the affected agency, after that time it is taken to have been\nallocated to the new agency; and\n\n(c) if an investigation under this Act had, before the change time,\nstarted in relation to the disclosure, the investigation may\ncontinue as if the disclosure had been made in relation to\nconduct that relates to the new agency; and",
      "skos:definition": "change\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) before the change time, a person disclosed information to an\nauthorised officer of an affected agency, or to a supervisor\nbelonging to the affected agency; and\n\n(b) the information concerns conduct that is taken to relate to the\nnew agency under section 73B; and\n\n(c) immediately before the change time, consideration of the\ndisclosure under this Act had not started, or (if it had started)\nhad not ended.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) the disclosure is taken to have been made to an authorised\nofficer of the new agency, or to a supervisor belonging to the\nnew agency; and\n\n(b) if the disclosure had, before the change time, been allocated\nto the affected agency, after that time it is taken to have been\nallocated to the new agency; and\n\n(c) if an investigation under this Act had, before the change time,\nstarted in relation to the disclosure, the investigation may\ncontinue as if the disclosure had been made in relation to\nconduct that relates to the new agency; and",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73c-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "12ea12eace7d655f471ce55e34f89b1b77a3d9d05a445ca82877dd2235beaa51"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-73c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "73C Machinery of government changes—disclosures made before",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 105,
      "values:originalText": "change\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) before the change time, a person disclosed information to an\nauthorised officer of an affected agency, or to a supervisor\nbelonging to the affected agency; and\n\n(b) the information concerns conduct that is taken to relate to the\nnew agency under section 73B; and\n\n(c) immediately before the change time, consideration of the\ndisclosure under this Act had not started, or (if it had started)\nhad not ended.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) the disclosure is taken to have been made to an authorised\nofficer of the new agency, or to a supervisor belonging to the\nnew agency; and\n\n(b) if the disclosure had, before the change time, been allocated\nto the affected agency, after that time it is taken to have been\nallocated to the new agency; and\n\n(c) if an investigation under this Act had, before the change time,\nstarted in relation to the disclosure, the investigation may\ncontinue as if the disclosure had been made in relation to\nconduct that relates to the new agency; and"
    },
    {
