      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) before the change time, a person disclosed information to an\nauthorised officer of an affected agency, or to a supervisor\nbelonging to the affected agency; and\n\n(b) the information concerns conduct that is taken to relate to the\nnew agency under section 73B; and\n\n(c) immediately before the change time, consideration of the\ndisclosure under this Act had not started, or (if it had started)\nhad not ended."
    },
