    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73c-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "73C(2) Machinery of government changes—disclosures made before",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-73c-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.105",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) the disclosure is taken to have been made to an authorised\nofficer of the new agency, or to a supervisor belonging to the\nnew agency; and\n\n(b) if the disclosure had, before the change time, been allocated\nto the affected agency, after that time it is taken to have been\nallocated to the new agency; and\n\n(c) if an investigation under this Act had, before the change time,\nstarted in relation to the disclosure, the investigation may\ncontinue as if the disclosure had been made in relation to\nconduct that relates to the new agency; and",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) the disclosure is taken to have been made to an authorised\nofficer of the new agency, or to a supervisor belonging to the\nnew agency; and\n\n(b) if the disclosure had, before the change time, been allocated\nto the affected agency, after that time it is taken to have been\nallocated to the new agency; and\n\n(c) if an investigation under this Act had, before the change time,\nstarted in relation to the disclosure, the investigation may\ncontinue as if the disclosure had been made in relation to\nconduct that relates to the new agency; and",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73c-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "95bbda3019a052f9c14000f429b6a48ca5dd775a30ac3f7c2b688e3cf0cf7979",
      "skos:note": "Machinery of government changes—disclosures made before"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-73c-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "73C(2) Machinery of government changes—disclosures made before",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 105,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) the disclosure is taken to have been made to an authorised\nofficer of the new agency, or to a supervisor belonging to the\nnew agency; and\n\n(b) if the disclosure had, before the change time, been allocated\nto the affected agency, after that time it is taken to have been\nallocated to the new agency; and\n\n(c) if an investigation under this Act had, before the change time,\nstarted in relation to the disclosure, the investigation may\ncontinue as if the disclosure had been made in relation to\nconduct that relates to the new agency; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-73c-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
