    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-74",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "74 Ombudsman may determine standards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-74"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.107",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Ombudsman may, by legislative instrument, determine\nstandards relating to the following:\n\n(a) procedures, to be complied with by the principal officers of\nagencies, for dealing with internal disclosures and possible\ninternal disclosures;\n\n(b) the conduct of investigations under this Act;\n\n(c) the preparation, under section 51, of reports of investigations\nunder this Act;\n\n(d) the giving of information and assistance under\nsubsection 76(3), and the keeping of records for the purposes\nof that subsection.\n\n(2) Before determining a standard, the Ombudsman must consult the\nIGIS.\n\n(3) The Ombudsman must ensure that standards are in force under\neach of paragraphs (1)(a), (b) and (c) at all times after the\ncommencement of this section.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Ombudsman may, by legislative instrument, determine\nstandards relating to the following:\n\n(a) procedures, to be complied with by the principal officers of\nagencies, for dealing with internal disclosures and possible\ninternal disclosures;\n\n(b) the conduct of investigations under this Act;\n\n(c) the preparation, under section 51, of reports of investigations\nunder this Act;\n\n(d) the giving of information and assistance under\nsubsection 76(3), and the keeping of records for the purposes\nof that subsection.\n\n(2) Before determining a standard, the Ombudsman must consult the\nIGIS.\n\n(3) The Ombudsman must ensure that standards are in force under\neach of paragraphs (1)(a), (b) and (c) at all times after the\ncommencement of this section.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-74-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-74-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-74-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4fb05f6fb266bb09828d98f1dc8b59ac40941732a1b2d2f0cf02a8351dc1cabd"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-74",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "74 Ombudsman may determine standards",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 107,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Ombudsman may, by legislative instrument, determine\nstandards relating to the following:\n\n(a) procedures, to be complied with by the principal officers of\nagencies, for dealing with internal disclosures and possible\ninternal disclosures;\n\n(b) the conduct of investigations under this Act;\n\n(c) the preparation, under section 51, of reports of investigations\nunder this Act;\n\n(d) the giving of information and assistance under\nsubsection 76(3), and the keeping of records for the purposes\nof that subsection.\n\n(2) Before determining a standard, the Ombudsman must consult the\nIGIS.\n\n(3) The Ombudsman must ensure that standards are in force under\neach of paragraphs (1)(a), (b) and (c) at all times after the\ncommencement of this section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-74-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
