    {
      "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-75",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "75 Restriction on the application of secrecy provisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-interest-disclosure-act-2013#sec-75"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.107",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A provision of a law of the Commonwealth that prohibits the\ndisclosure, recording or use of information does not apply to the\ndisclosure, recording or use of information if:\n\n(a) the disclosure, recording or use is in connection with the\nconduct of a disclosure investigation; or\n\n(b) the disclosure, recording or use is for the purposes of the\nperformance of the functions, or the exercise of the powers,\nconferred on a person by Part 3 or section 61 or 65; or\n\n(c) the disclosure, recording or use is in connection with giving a\nperson access to information for the purposes of, or in",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A provision of a law of the Commonwealth that prohibits the\ndisclosure, recording or use of information does not apply to the\ndisclosure, recording or use of information if:\n\n(a) the disclosure, recording or use is in connection with the\nconduct of a disclosure investigation; or\n\n(b) the disclosure, recording or use is for the purposes of the\nperformance of the functions, or the exercise of the powers,\nconferred on a person by Part 3 or section 61 or 65; or\n\n(c) the disclosure, recording or use is in connection with giving a\nperson access to information for the purposes of, or in",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-75-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-interest-disclosure-act-2013-sec-75-logic-deontic-1"
        },
