      "values:originalText": "(2) A person exercising functions or powers under a delegation under\nthis section must comply with any directions of the principal\nofficer who delegated the function or power.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A person exercising functions or powers under a delegation under\nthis section must comply with any directions of the principal\nofficer who delegated the function or power.",
