      },
      "dc:source": "public-interest-disclosure-act-2013.pdf, p.112",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Act does not, by implication, limit the investigative powers\nconferred on an agency or a public official by a law of the\nCommonwealth other than this Act.\n\n(2) This Act does not detract from any obligations imposed on an\nagency or a public official by a law of the Commonwealth other\nthan this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Act does not, by implication, limit the investigative powers\nconferred on an agency or a public official by a law of the\nCommonwealth other than this Act.\n\n(2) This Act does not detract from any obligations imposed on an\nagency or a public official by a law of the Commonwealth other\nthan this Act.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
